{"id":"9e6768aadf6214a6","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code.md","title":"The Finite-Pair Membership Relation K","display":"df-smullyan-finite-pair-code — The Finite-Pair Membership Relation K","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code"],"display":"df-smullyan-finite-pair-code — The Finite-Pair Membership Relation K","source":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–46，Lemma K（PDF 62–63）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-frames]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-finite-pair-code — The Finite-Pair Membership Relation K"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 45–46，Lemma K（PDF 62–63）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66e51676c0948f71\" href=\"?note=66e51676c0948f71\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-frames\">92-df-smullyan-frames</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MF}_{13}\">\\(\\operatorname{MF}_{13}\\)</span> 与位串片段关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66e51676c0948f71\" href=\"?note=66e51676c0948f71\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-frames\">92-df-smullyan-frames</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a_1,\\ldots,a_m]_{13}\">\\([a_1,\\ldots,a_m]_{13}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_1*_{13}\\cdots*_{13}a_m\">\\(a_1*_{13}\\cdots*_{13}a_m\\)</span> 的左结合值（固定 m≥2）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E\">\\(K_E\\)</span> 为下文的三元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}finite\\text{-}pair\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nK_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\leq z\\;[\n\\operatorname{MF}_{13}(f,z)\\land\n\\operatorname{Part}_{13}([f,f,x,f,y,f,f]_{13},z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,x)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,y)],\\\\\nK_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\Rightarrow x\\leq z\\land y\\leq z,\\qquad\nK_E\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}finite\\text{-}pair\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nK_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\leq z\\;[\n\\operatorname{MF}_{13}(f,z)\\land\n\\operatorname{Part}_{13}([f,f,x,f,y,f,f]_{13},z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,x)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,y)],\\\\\nK_E(x,y,z)&amp;\\Rightarrow x\\leq z\\land y\\leq z,\\qquad\nK_E\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PDF 63 图像中最后两个片段关系带否定线：最长框架不得出现在 x 或 y 的载荷内。OCR 容易漏掉这些否定；改成正片段条件会完全破坏分隔机制。</p>\n<p>所需固定次数拼接的结果以及中间值可界于 z；片段因而也界于 z，所有量词可以有界。K 是任意有限数对集合的成员图，不是第 III 章 # 分隔的有序序列解码器；它既不保证集合编码唯一，也不承诺保留重复和次序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-frames","status":"resolved","id":"66e51676c0948f71","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-frames]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-frames","status":"resolved","id":"66e51676c0948f71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{MF}_{13}$ 与位串片段关系见 [[92-df-smullyan-frames]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MF}_{13}","display":false},{"tex":"[a_1,\\ldots,a_m]_{13}","display":false},{"tex":"a_1*_{13}\\cdots*_{13}a_m","display":false},{"tex":"K_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}finite\\text{-}pair\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nK_E(x,y,z)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\leq z\\;[\n\\operatorname{MF}_{13}(f,z)\\land\n\\operatorname{Part}_{13}([f,f,x,f,y,f,f]_{13},z)\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,x)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Part}_{13}(f,y)],\\\\\nK_E(x,y,z)&\\Rightarrow x\\leq z\\land y\\leq z,\\qquad\nK_E\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1631,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c0fd5c6fd5532ff","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无指数算术化：[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] → [[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]] → [[92-df-smullyan-frames]] → [[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]。"},{"id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0c7c8d1473c7d455","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]]"}],"outgoing":["66e51676c0948f71"]}